# 🩺 SkinCheck AI — Explainable Skin Disease Risk Screener

An **Explainable AI-based skin disease risk screening application** that analyzes an uploaded skin-lesion image and predicts the most likely lesion category, provides a confidence score, assigns a **Low / Medium / High risk level**, and generates a **Grad-CAM heatmap** to visualize the region of the image that influenced the model's prediction.

> ⚠️ **Medical Disclaimer:** SkinCheck AI is an educational and research-oriented screening aid. It is **not a medical diagnostic system** and should not be used as a substitute for examination or advice from a qualified healthcare professional.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

SkinCheck AI combines **Deep Learning, Computer Vision, Explainable AI, and Flask** to create an interpretable skin-lesion screening system.

Traditional deep-learning image classifiers can behave like "black boxes": they produce a prediction without explaining why.

SkinCheck AI addresses this problem by incorporating **Grad-CAM (Gradient-weighted Class Activation Mapping)**. The system produces a heatmap that highlights the image regions that contributed most strongly to the model's prediction.

