# 🔍 Explainable AI with Grad-CAM

One of the main features of SkinCheck AI is **Grad-CAM**.

## What is Grad-CAM?

Grad-CAM stands for:

**Gradient-weighted Class Activation Mapping**

It is an Explainable AI technique that helps visualize the areas of an image that contributed to a neural network's prediction.

Instead of displaying only:

```text
Prediction → Melanoma
```

SkinCheck AI attempts to provide:

```text
Prediction → Melanoma

        +
        
Explanation → Heatmap showing influential image regions
```

### Example workflow

```text
Original Image
      │
      ▼
Deep Learning Model
      │
      ▼
Predicted Class
      │
      ▼
Grad-CAM
      │
      ▼
Heatmap
      │
      ▼
Overlay on Original Image
```

This makes the system more interpretable than a conventional black-box classifier.

