# 📈 Model Evaluation

The model should be evaluated using a separate test dataset.

Recommended evaluation metrics include:

### Accuracy

```text
Accuracy = Correct Predictions / Total Predictions
```

### Precision

Measures how many predicted positive cases were actually positive.

### Recall

Measures how many actual positive cases were correctly identified.

### F1-Score

Provides a balance between precision and recall.

### Confusion Matrix

Helps identify which lesion classes are being confused by the model.

Example evaluation:

```text
              precision    recall    f1-score

Class 1          0.XX       0.XX        0.XX
Class 2          0.XX       0.XX        0.XX
Class 3          0.XX       0.XX        0.XX
...
```

Replace these placeholders with the actual results from your trained model.

