# 🔬 Grad-CAM Implementation

The project contains a dedicated explainability module:

```text
04_gradcam_explainability.py
```

The module performs tasks such as:

```text
Input Image
    ↓
Preprocessing
    ↓
Model Prediction
    ↓
Target Class
    ↓
Gradient Calculation
    ↓
Activation Map
    ↓
Heatmap
    ↓
Heatmap + Original Image
```

The final visualization helps users understand **which image regions influenced the prediction**.

