# 🔐 Privacy Considerations

Skin images may contain sensitive personal information.

The application should therefore:

* Avoid unnecessarily storing uploaded images.
* Delete temporary images when they are no longer required.
* Avoid exposing uploaded images publicly.
* Avoid storing personally identifiable information.
* Secure any database used by the application.
* Use HTTPS when deployed to production.

